And the results are in! There are three pages:

http://alt.org/nethack/wishes.html
http://alt.org/nethack/wishes-n.html
http://alt.org/nethack/wishes-c.html

The first does no processing whatsoever. The second has every number
replaced with "N" (to try to account for people wishing for +2 and +3).
The third attempts to remove words like "blessed" and "the" to get an
accurate count for wishing for particular items.

I myself am surprised at how high gauntlets of power showed up.. number
seven. I guess it's because of the whole Valkyrie thing.

